    "name": "White Russian",
    "instructions": "1. Combine the vodka, coffee liqueur and ice cubes in a cocktail shaker\n2. Shake well and strain into an ice-filled short tumbler\n3. Lightly beat the single cream until just frothy and pour onto the drink over the back of a spoon, to help make it float",
